# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local git mein nahi jata.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Site ka asli domain — stand wala QR isi par point karta hai.
# Set na karo to QR https://nextbite.com.au par jayega.
# Trailing slash ki zaroorat nahi.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://nextbite.com.au

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ENQUIRY DELIVERY
#
# Form /api/enquiry par POST hota hai. Wahan se enquiry do
# jagah ja sakti hai:
#
#   1. DISK — hamesha. .data/enquiries/enquiries.jsonl mein
#      likhi jati hai, attachment .data/enquiries/files/ mein.
#      Yeh normal Node server (VPS, Docker, `next start`) par
#      theek hai.
#
#      ⚠ Vercel / Netlify jaisi serverless hosting par disk
#        har request ke baad khatam ho jati hai — wahan neeche
#        wala webhook ZAROOR set karo, warna enquiries kho
#        jayengi.
#
#   2. WEBHOOK — agar yeh set ho. Enquiry ka JSON is URL par
#      POST hota hai. Zapier / Make / n8n / Slack — jahan se
#      aap ise Travis ke inbox tak pohancha sakte ho.
#
# Dono nakaam hon to API 500 deta hai aur user ko email par
# raabta karne ko kehta hai — taake koi lead khamoshi se
# zaya na ho.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.zapier.com/hooks/catch/xxxxx/yyyyy
